 "title": "Rebel Battery Harasses Union Shipping",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🧨",
 "sentences": [
  "A rebel battery harassed Union shipping!",
  "Captain Westley F. Roberts formed the unit in Arkansas in September 1862.",
  "They packed 2 12-pounder rifles and 2 6-pounder smoothbores.",
  "The unit fought in the Battle of Prairie Grove on December 7.",
  "Lieutenant Samuel T. Ruffner took over after Roberts resigned in Little Rock.",
  "They fired back as the rear guard during the Confederate retreat."
